+====================================================================+
|                     SAFETY BACKPLANE (DISCRETE)                    |
| Cold-Start → Multi-Sensor Matrix → Hysteresis → Master Latch       |
+====================================================================+

   POWER & BASELINES
   -----------------
   [BAT+]----[FUSE]----+-------------------------------+
                       |                               |
                      [RSENSE]                         |
                       |                               |
                      NODE_I                           |
                                                        |
   [BAT-]------------------------------------------------+---- GND


======================================================================
  1. COLD-START DELAY BLOCK
======================================================================

   [BAT+]----[RCH] 100kΩ----+---- NODE_DELAY ----[Q1] NPN ---> DELAY_OK
                            |
                           [CDELAY] 10µF
                            |
                           GND

   BEHAVIOR:
     - On power-up, CDELAY is empty → DELAY_OK = LOW.
     - After RC charge time → DELAY_OK = HIGH.


======================================================================
  2. MULTI-SENSOR FIRE-PREVENTION MATRIX
======================================================================

   SENSORS:
     NODE_I    (current sense)
     NODE_TH   (hotspot thermistor)
     NODE_CASE (enclosure thermistor)
     NODE_AIR  (airflow switch or thermal vane)

   COMPARATORS:
     U_I    : NODE_I    vs I_REF_MAX   → I_FAULT
     U_TH   : NODE_TH   vs T_REF_HOT   → TH_FAULT
     U_CASE : NODE_CASE vs T_REF_CASE  → CASE_FAULT
     U_AIR  : NODE_AIR  vs AIR_MIN     → AIR_FAULT

   LOGIC OR (discrete):
     I_FAULT ----\
                  +----> MATRIX_FAULT
     TH_FAULT ---/
     CASE_FAULT -\
                  +----> MATRIX_FAULT
     AIR_FAULT --/

   MATRIX_FAULT ----[Q2] NPN ---> FAULT_LINE


======================================================================
  3. THERMAL HYSTERESIS BLOCK
======================================================================

   NODE_TH --> U_HI (trip comparator)
                IN+ = NODE_TH
                IN- = T_HIGH_REF
                → HOT_FAULT

   NODE_TH --> U_LO (reset comparator)
                IN+ = NODE_TH
                IN- = T_LOW_REF
                → COOL_OK

   HOT_FAULT ----[Q3] NPN----> HYST_SET
   COOL_OK  ----[Q4] NPN----> HYST_RESET

   SR LATCH:
     HYST_SET ----\
                   +----> HYST_LATCH_OUT
     HYST_RESET ---/

   HYST_LATCH_OUT → HYST_FAULT


======================================================================
  4. MASTER SAFETY LATCH (GLOBAL)
======================================================================

   FAULT_LINE ----\
                   +----> MASTER_SET
   HYST_FAULT ----/

   MASTER_SET ----[Q5] NPN----> MASTER_LATCH_SET

   RESET_SW ----[Q6] NPN----> MASTER_LATCH_RESET

   CROSS-COUPLED LATCH:
     MASTER_LATCH_SET ----> QLATCH_M
     MASTER_LATCH_RESET --> QLATCH_MB

   QLATCH_M → MASTER_FAULT_OUT (HIGH = latched fault)


======================================================================
  5. GLOBAL OUTPUT
======================================================================

   GLOBAL_SHUTDOWN:
     MASTER_FAULT_OUT ----> GLOBAL_SHUTDOWN (HIGH = system inhibited)

   LED indicators:
     MATRIX_FAULT ----[RLED1]----> LED_MATRIX
     HYST_FAULT   ----[RLED2]----> LED_HYST
     MASTER_FAULT_OUT ----[RLED3]----> LED_MASTER

+====================================================================+
| SUMMARY                                                            |
| - Cold-start delay prevents inrush activation.                     |
| - Multi-sensor matrix detects current, heat, enclosure temp, air.  |
| - Hysteresis ensures cooldown before re-enable.                    |
| - Master latch prevents auto-restart after fault.                  |
| - Entire system is discrete, retro, MCU-free.                      |
| - No load or driver included — purely a safety supervisor.         |
+====================================================================+
